From 7c044c6da337fcefca35814b682915ee6ef4cd7b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 12:51:52 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Account ledger: restate another strategy's two-sided
 market from the venue's fills when that strategy's order ledger agrees order
 by order

cpc-btc-updown-5m-2026-11-21-0620z: seventeen maker fills (UP 0.49 for
0.2948, DOWN 0.61 for 0.2957), DOWN won, cash moved +0.0195. This ledger
adopted one net snapshot (DOWN 0.10 at the $1 bound) and retired the market
at 0.00; the exact GROSS and VENUE_NET forms refuse and the row stays wrong.

New form VENUE_FILLS_EQUAL_SIBLING_LEDGER, OFF unless
L5_SIBLING_LEDGER_ATTESTATION=VENUE_FILLS_AND_SIBLING_LEDGER. Only for a
market in another registered strategy's series, only after settlement, and
only when the venue's activity feed and that strategy's published order
ledger state the same orders with the same side, quantity and cost; fees
must be readable and zero; a side this ledger knew is never repriced; the
row must have settled after the last re-anchor. Any miss keeps the bound.
An already exhausted market is re-read at most three times. 24 tests.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
